份打击非法采矿和黑帮活动。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;犯罪问题现在与政治发生冲突。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;南非人将于 11 月 4 日&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/rEj3iM5acwwqYgcvlZ3lyfgevFPDoRbAsqjbZluCBmm06tkJiQAXPPaHlwxNW_2OnD4jghbsnluGH28lSIBl01Fb0WtR4qXjXUM97RQ2VfVkzdUfX5SjBzcvqhj7KKCtw9boiWTtSZPU5VlyBl2sLbX3mUbsCKPea7LMaxKqVZb0PU31f-2Gogx-hIlHufnDvO3apCuabTiE-lSkhmKnt6Fq8DRbuRCl038fJYwqpYZEQZzf8GHTjl1NL1xlpl0-dUxeaX4AfP0bFrZpgGpv6bffEyupOmLiJYDc80PSvDxgSjFyjnn6uCzH9jyZVLAC-nqcO_93JjkS8G0X9npINdIhWaWWyalYLzXSOmigxjHnE_KxrYvLYPiJYrenhk--qLKwjDkF85yODD9VzBVArqk64pjBqMBPuIELx2LsmZJF0ujVYdqRBwpO47XX9Ejkx_YCDFuBZPssltIZTRtVuaJTyZ6gNA6fct8JSXI1AwSfOhfomuMlO8Zg2QVWnooxa-gyfHTgE_xX92SeUt9wV5siG0DibgnlqksUFjMsfCpTUQ/vb8IyzKApeZOehvuxwge8mJFDKs31-1l/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="南非民意调查显示非国大在约翰内斯堡投票前领先"&gt;举行市政选举&lt;/a&gt;，届时当地治安、街道照明和基本服务将重新回到政治话题中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;对于拉马福萨来说，挑战不再只是承诺严厉打击犯罪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;他需要说服一个习惯于听到此类承诺的国家，这一次，事情将会真正发生改变。 &lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;—&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/T1oITvX0fi8uQLjaKqJZNCcviFBpoT0ALfp2d8b-OdsFSx_KgjZv0tK8GdKsRJFTQSrPaogsJ1mBdzYBhvrbXNfiK8SGPs4s7v6u7lcuX60N_LWxL2s3_2S-tUyRm4FTglhkItH4K0R7t_AnSZWEp7lY492XraoC36TG8-nwDg8Sg4tVb1MZv5bB4u1l349kyB9Sa3HDsXUsRs6Itv_EidXAPGEolHCNFu3geOXerqWykt468WetoLyH2aVlWdiGvXeG3eUJvEkbDjMblHG68FDvw6lmSt2eS7l7exjN2msoqk6mr03BT8slcap5547wNCHHYSvOCjzrJDZfLEKiC1ctDvOl8oCTtrCTUCohUydxnyks04Rb10mW69HvHNTEawR2vfpxGqw4OdUuKBrndKjPu5n2BaFXaFrvSVxeE6sNOvBqxK3c5aIPkWZZbituf3MWKTX5XaF0rSnPbmhzNlz0mbz-vXSswgrZaMEErJxrys4c1I1_lzU/3TZknFcQMws1Lq_a6-_yzCzseO5TJiOA/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="S&amp;#39;thembil Cele - 政府记者 |彭博社"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;塞姆比尔·塞勒&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&g